{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight against Soviet Robots in the new Soviet Punk action-shooter game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world where <strong>the Cold War never ended</strong> and the <strong>machines have taken control</strong>. Witness the ruins of the Old World and the horrors of a new dystopian reality. Harness your cybernetic abilities and unleash your fury to <strong>bring down the USSR once and for all</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/85a1bdec2e1fc4c43060de38f56aad21.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/85a1bdec2e1fc4c43060de38f56aad21.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/85a1bdec2e1fc4c43060de38f56aad21.mp4?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a386a33b2c05ecb3344706d6c3cfea19.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a386a33b2c05ecb3344706d6c3cfea19.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/a386a33b2c05ecb3344706d6c3cfea19.mp4?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your full power</strong> against the Red Army\u2019s mechanical legions. Engage in <strong>fast-paced</strong>, brutal combat where <strong>precision and aggression are key</strong>. Slice through waves of Soviet robots, chain attacks for devastating combos, and <strong>use power-ups</strong> to gain the upper hand. Feel the impact of every hit in an intense atmosphere inspired by action game icons <strong>like DOOM</strong> and <strong>Ruiner</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/21538122dd59ab86f786bd968c015b4c.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/21538122dd59ab86f786bd968c015b4c.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/21538122dd59ab86f786bd968c015b4c.mp4?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/5fd389a91ad01dacb3dcac942fcefcec.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/5fd389a91ad01dacb3dcac942fcefcec.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/5fd389a91ad01dacb3dcac942fcefcec.mp4?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cruel world, <strong>death is not the end</strong>;\u00a0 it\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every failure, you awaken in the <strong>Hub Area</strong>, a hidden base where the remnants of freedom still breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you will <strong>unlock new abilities and weapon loadouts</strong> to help you push deeper into the city\u2019s mechanical heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around <strong>roguelite progression</strong>, the game rewards persistence; each run reshapes your path and objective. Gather currencies, hunt bosses, and improve your skill to <strong>gain new tools of destruction</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall, rebuild, and return stronger</strong>; until the System finally breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/9807fd66c7ed1e675245071eb8707fa6.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/9807fd66c7ed1e675245071eb8707fa6.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/9807fd66c7ed1e675245071eb8707fa6.mp4?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/be398a8deedb687ca508ff537c8385d9.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/be398a8deedb687ca508ff537c8385d9.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/be398a8deedb687ca508ff537c8385d9.mp4?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world under <strong>total surveillance</strong>, where every move is tracked and every choice has already been predicted. Privacy is a relic of the past. Beneath the flicker of neon lights and the shadow of post-Soviet architecture, you will <strong>uncover the truth</strong>. Everything serves the System, and even <strong>you are part of its design</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the forgotten districts and the crumbling remnants of the past. Walk through abandoned neighborhoods that once pulsed with life and see what became of those who resisted the System. Liberate the survivors, rebuild the insurgency, and <strong>rise together against the Red Star</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Project System Breakdown by Anarchy Creations is co-financed by European Funds for Smart Economy 2021-2027 under the KPT ScaleUP Booster program.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/18989badb83651e84820295ca815a267.avif?t=1773774397\" width=1040 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/98501b4848d01ee96854b9ad9ac88978.avif?t=1773774397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras_big/98501b4848d01ee96854b9ad9ac88978.avif?t=1773774397 width=1560 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3300050?t=1773774397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3300050?t=1773774397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/2a99fa713d3eaa8308ff9a9b2b83cb712325ee96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773774397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/2a99fa713d3eaa8308ff9a9b2b83cb712325ee96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773774397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1773774397\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1773774397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300050/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?